SELECT "TraficSourceID", "SearchEngineID", "AdvEngineID", CASE WHEN ("SearchEngineID" = 0 AND "AdvEngineID" = 0) THEN "Referer" ELSE '' END AS Src, "URL" AS Dst, COUNT(*) AS PageViews FROM hits WHERE "CounterID" = 62 AND "EventDate" >= 15887 AND "EventDate" <= 15917 AND "IsRefresh" = 0 GROUP BY "TraficSourceID", "SearchEngineID", "AdvEngineID", CASE WHEN ("SearchEngineID" = 0 AND "AdvEngineID" = 0) THEN "Referer" ELSE '' END, "URL" ORDER BY PageViews DESC LIMIT 10 OFFSET 1000;
